    "body": "> The one main change needs from my initial straw man is to remove \"specified\" from the `HueInterpolationMethod` enum, as it is no longer part of CSS.\n\nActually, I forgot that the remaining RGB colorspaces were added as well, so the other change is that the `ColorInterpolationMethod` enum should be expanded to:\n\n```\nenum ColorInterpolationMethod {\n  \"srgb\",\n  \"srgb-linear\",\n  \"display-p3\",\n  \"a98-rgb\",\n  \"prophoto-rgb\",\n  \"rec2020\",\n  \"lab\",\n  \"oklab\",\n  \"xyz\",\n  \"xyz-d50\",\n  \"xyz-d65\",\n  \"hsl\",\n  \"hwb\",\n  \"lch\",\n  \"oklch\"\n };\n``` ",
